{
    "background_story": "Kelvin was a renowned botanist who spent most of his life studying the ancient forests of Asia. His fascination with the rare and exotic Drynaria fern led him to the remote mountains of Nepal. After years of searching, Kelvin finally discovered a hidden valley where the Drynaria grew in abundance. As he delved deeper into the valley, he uncovered evidence of the fern's extraordinary healing properties. Kelvin's groundbreaking research on the Drynaria earned him international recognition and acclaim. He continued to study and protect the fern, working tirelessly to preserve its habitat and share its benefits with the world. Kelvin's dedication to the Drynaria and its preservation became a testament to his passion for the natural world and his commitment to its conservation.",
